  "_meta": {
    "notes": "A Gemini crew that cannot be filled, and the two names that are the reason. RP-1 refuses the whole command by the name of the first student it will not take rather than starting the course a seat short, so a generic failure would send an operator through the roster hunting for who. Valentina is off-world and Nedcas is standing down after a flight, both dark and both carrying their reason; Ludrey is picked and is the only name the career has left, one short of the two Gemini needs. The dark Enrol says which arithmetic failed, not that something did",
    "why-two-refusals": "One dark name reads as that kerbal's problem. Two, for two different reasons, is what makes the sentence a fact about the CAREER: this crew is not available this month",
    "why-an-applicant-in-the-roster": "Sinta is an APPLICANT, and she is here to be absent from the picker. RP-1 refuses a kerbal who is not yet crew, so candidatesOf drops an applicant rather than refusing them, and a roster that carries nobody with isApplicant set never exercises that branch on any render"
